        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/LibreChart/LibreChart/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md" rel="noopener">Read CONTRIBUTING</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="license-card">
      <span class="lic-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v18M3 7l9-4 9 4M6 10v6M18 10v6M4 16h4M16 16h4"/></svg>GPL-2.0</span>
      <h3>Yours to run and adapt</h3>
      <p>Everything you need to deploy, extend, or fork LibreChart is public.</p>
